e specifically looking  for the services or products that you  provide so I would for sure if I'm  looking  conversions for our business still focus  on the SEO side of things and driving  people from search engines because they  have a much higher intent to buy after  that I look at my newsletters I think my  newsletter converts way better than my  Twitter or Facebook or YouTube again  here you will to send a message to  somebody's inbox and you're pretty much  you know guarantee that it's going to  reach them unless unless they blocked  you off as spam or blacklisted you  that's the case you provide better  content but for the people who do like  what you do you're pretty much  guaranteed to get their attention  through an email we're with Facebook and  Twitter it's much more timely and same  with YouTube it's it's what's happening  right now and some of the half life of a  facebook books I think there's only a  couple hours and for twitter i'm sure  it's much less so unless they happen to  be on right at that moment they're not  going to see your message and so every  time you post something you're hitting a  portion of your audience where somebody  comes up for your newsletter you can  send it out they may not check their  email till the next day but they're  still going to see that message that you  have with the sale of the new promotion  that you're putting out as long as they  want to see it we're with Facebook or  Twitter if they don't check until the  next day your message is gone it's just  going to be buried for everything else  that was put up so you know the ability  to convert people is much higher my news  that our list then from Twitter or  Facebook just an example we have as of  right now around 60,000 people are our  newsletter and 105 or so thousand people  on our Twitter and I get way better  results for my newsletter list and I  would from my Twitter not that I ignore  footer I love Twitter spend a lot of  time on Twitter same thing with facebook  and youtube and and I get a lot of great  personal satisfaction and joy from using  those because I I get immediate feedback  from people and they tell me that what  I'm doing is awesome and it's changed  their lives and that makes me feel  really good makes you want to do more so  there's a lot of value there but  if I had to pick of something that I was  only focused on conversions then I would  look definitely at search engine  optimization driving search engine  traffic and building up my newsletter so  I guess we're still in 2009 don't know  if that's changed much in terms of  conversion rates but thank you feel I  questioned on I hope that helped answer  your question for those of you watching  if you liked the video please get a  thumbs up I do these videos because I I  love doing it and I love seeing the  thumbs up to come in so thank you and if  you have a question about social media  or conversions or another question for  your business feel free to leave it in  the comments below and I read every one  of them and do my best to try to respond  to everybody as well so thank you and  we'll see you on the next episode  you
 

